WEBVTT

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:08.457
This video shows how to check curriculum coverage on a phone: which topics are taught, which are tested, and which are not covered yet.

00:00:10.126 --> 00:00:16.894
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Planning and Delivery, and then choose Curriculum Coverage.

00:00:17.574 --> 00:00:28.758
Choose the class and the subject. Three tiles show the total topics, how many are taught and how many are tested. Each topic is listed below as a card.

00:00:37.271 --> 00:00:44.543
Tap the Coverage Filter and choose Uncovered. Only the topics that are not covered yet stay in the list.

00:00:54.740 --> 00:01:03.068
Tap Timeline. The months of the academic year run along the top, and a green dot marks a topic that has been taught.

00:01:06.204 --> 00:01:10.116
Now you can see what has been covered and what is still left.
